.DS_Store

# Reproducible from src/01_download.py and src/03_clean_eavs.py
# respectively — PROJECT_PLAN.md always intended these excluded; never
# enforced until now. data/processed/ stays committed on purpose (see
# README.md: a reviewer cloning the repo shouldn't have to re-download
# or re-clean just to run the estimation).
data/raw/
data/interim/

# Python / R build noise
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.pytest_cache/
.Rhistory

# Claude Code local session/tool state — never project content
.claude/

# Process/planning documentation, untracked at the user's request —
# kept locally, not published to GitHub. Patterns (not just exact
# names) so future planning docs are excluded automatically.
*PLAN*.md
*HANDOFF*.md
*VALIDATION*.md
.env

# Generated analysis outputs and the test suite — not src, not data,
# untracked at the user's request; kept locally, not published.
# NOTE: docs/data/*.json is also generated (by src/06_estimate.R and
# src/07_figures.py) but stays tracked on purpose — it's fetched at
# runtime by the published dashboard (index.html, style.css, app.js at
# the repo root; GitHub Pages serves the repo root, not docs/).
output/
tests/
